:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=153  valign=center  style="width:114.8000pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:'宋 体';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></td><td width=153  valign=center  style="width:114.8500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:'宋 体';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=595  valign=top  colspan=4  style="width:446.3000pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="line-height:15.0000pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >汇报对象：高级经理<font face="STSong-Light" >/</font><font face="宋体" >总监&nbsp;</font><font face="STSong-Light" >|&nbsp;</font><font face="宋体" >下属人数：</font><font face="STSong-Light" >3&nbsp;|&nbsp;</font><font face="宋体" >所在地区：北京&nbsp;</font><font face="STSong-Light" >|&nbsp;</font><font face="宋体" >所在部门：自有品牌部&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=135  valign=top  style="width:101.8500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="text-align:left;line-height:15.0000pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >工作职责和业绩：</span><span style="font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:'宋 体';mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=459  valign=top  colspan=3  style="width:344.4500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="line-height:15.0000pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >1.<font face="宋体" >搭建自有品牌产品团队，负责自有品牌产品规划、开发和运营工作；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2.<font face="宋体" >根据产品特点（如产地、配料、工艺等），挖掘产品卖点，提升产品竞争力，维持正常毛利；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >3.<font face="宋体" >完成公司各项销售、毛利及周转等考核指标；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >4.<font face="宋体" >密切关注市场行情，进行自有品牌产品线确定，品类风险控制，跟踪产品质量，产品升级，运营策略调整；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >5.<font face="宋体" >品牌塑造，提升品牌价值，培养顾客品牌忠诚度；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >6.<font face="宋体" >开发优质</font><font face="STSong-Light" >OEM</font><font face="宋体" >供应商，维护和评估供应商资源，完善采购流程，降低开发、采购成本；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >7.<font face="宋体" >与供应商进行合同、促销、价格谈判沟通；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >8.<font face="宋体" >协调与其它部门之间的配合，危机事件处理；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >9.<font face="宋体" >食品部人员能力提升，部门团队建设。</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >自有品牌产品<font face="STSong-Light" >2013</font><font face="宋体" >年上市，至</font><font face="STSong-Light" >2015</font><font face="宋体" >年已开发</font><font face="STSong-Light" >SKU180</font><font face="宋体" >个，涉及品类</font><font face="STSong-Light" >:</font><font face="宋体" >坚果、蜜饯果干、肉干肉脯、饼干蛋糕、糖果、方便食品、蜂蜜、茶叶、特产、调味品、粮油、礼盒、熟食、生鲜等；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >自有品牌产品在品类销售排名均为前十，茶叶、核桃、蜂蜜、罐头、熟食等分类排&nbsp;名&nbsp;第&nbsp;一&nbsp;；</span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2015<font face="宋体" >年京东商城全部食品品牌排名，自有品牌毛利率排&nbsp;名&nbsp;第&nbsp;一&nbsp;（</font><font face="STSong-Light" >37%</font><font face="宋体" >），半年内复购率</font><font face="STSong-Light" >63%</font><font face="宋体" >，成为京东食品利润最高、成长最快的品牌；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >通过产品规划、促销规划，实现品类明星单品打造，并对规划和促销方法进行总结，形成一套有效且可复制的方法论，通过该模式，自有品牌产品<font face="STSong-Light" >2</font><font face="宋体" >个月</font><font face="STSong-Light" >-4</font><font face="宋体" >个月即可打造一款品类明星单品，且毛利率不低于</font><font face="STSong-Light" >30%</font><font face="宋体" >；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >OEM<font face="宋体" >厂家均为国内知名大型工厂，供求关系良好，非常有兴趣与京东自有品牌共同研发新品；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >食品部人员能力迅速提升，深受领导和其它部门同事认可。&nbsp;</span