ace="宋体" >和转化率方法，进行运营策略调整；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >6.<font face="宋体" >开发优质</font><font face="STSong-Light" >OEM</font><font face="宋体" >供应商，维护和评估供应商资源，降低开发、采购成本；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >7.<font face="宋体" >与供应商进行合同、促销、价格谈判沟通。</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >上市前期工作使初期上市产品有精准的品类定位，通过目标客户营销提升产品转化率，快速提升商品排名，并积累一批优质客户，每日营销操作不低于<font face="STSong-Light" >20</font><font face="宋体" >次。&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=102  valign=top  style="width:76.9000pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(234,234,234);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="