000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="text-align:left;line-height:15.0000pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >工作职责和业绩：</span><span style="font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:'宋 体';mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=459  valign=top  colspan=3  style="width:344.4500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="line-height:15.0000pt;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >1<font face="宋体" >、供应商开发、选择、谈判工作，建立供应商考核机制，储备行业优秀供方及战略供方；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2<font face="宋体" >、市场调查和日常监测，及时对行业动态进行分析反馈，并对产品及供应商价格趋势分析，控制采购成本；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >3<font face="宋体" >、整体商品规划、分配、实施执行工作；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >4<font face="宋体" >、负责品牌商品的类别更新，新产品引入，通过询比价及竞价进行采购价格确认；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >5<font face="宋体" >、进行合同条款确认、洽谈、签订、执行及监督，维护供应商关系；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >6<font face="宋体" >、定期维护合格供方，关注并管理延迟交货，对采购和运营过程中发生的异常进行反馈，并跟进处理结果；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >7<font face="宋体" >、根据历史销售情况预估采购需求，设立安全库存，预防滞销产生、控制商品滞销；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >8<font face="宋体" >、公司重大销售时间点采购计划和促销活动制定；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >9<font face="宋体" >、与财务、质量部门合作，进行产品质量跟踪，供应商结算工作；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >10<font face="宋体" >、优化采购流程及团队日常管理；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >11<font face="宋体" >、参与公司内审和供应商外审。</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><spa