st-font-family:'宋 体';mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >北京京东世纪贸易有限公司&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=74  valign=top  style="width:55.5500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-right:-9.3500pt;mso-para-margin-right:-0.7800gd;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >项目简介：</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >项目目标：提升利润、质量控制、创新产品、提升顾客粘性。</span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >通过数据对京东顾客进行人群定位、购买习惯分析、产品规划、开发和运营，例如：常规在京东购买的顾客，更关注产品质量，我们的产品要在质量方面与其它品牌产品有显而易见的区别。</span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >联合大型优质厂家，通过双方共赢的模式，进行战略合作，通过顾客反馈的情况，进行产品升级。&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=74  valign=top  style="width:55.5500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-right:-9.3500pt;mso-para-margin-right:-0.7800gd;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >项目职责：</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >1<font face="宋体" >、团队搭建；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2<font face="宋体" >、产品规划、开发、运营、升级；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >3<font face="宋体" >、库存规划；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >4<font face="宋体" >、风险控制。&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=74  valign=top  style="width:55.5500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-right:-9.3500pt;mso-para-margin-right:-0.7800gd;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >项目业绩：</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >食品开发<font face="STSong-Light" >SKU180</font><font face="宋体" >个，涉及品类</font><font face="STSong-Light" >:</font><font face="宋体" >坚果、蜜饯果干、肉干肉脯、饼干蛋糕、糖果、方便食品、蜂蜜、茶叶、特产、调味品、粮油、礼盒、熟食、生鲜等；&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >自有品牌产品在品类销售排名均为前十，茶叶、核桃、蜂蜜、罐头、熟食等分类排&nbsp;名&nbsp;第&nbsp;一&nbsp;；&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2015<font face="宋体" >年京东商城食品排名，自有品牌食品毛利率排&nbsp;名&nbsp;第&nbsp;一&nbsp;（毛利率</font><font face="STSong-Light" >37%</font><font face="宋体" >），半年内复购率</font><font face="STSong-Light" >63%</font><font face="宋体" >，成为京东食品利润最高品牌；&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >通过产品规划、促销规划，实现品类明星单品打造，并对规划和促销方法进行总结，形成一套有效且可复制的方法论，通过该模式，自有品牌产品<font face="STSong-Light" >2</font><font face="宋体" >个月</font><font face="STSong-Light" >-4</font><font face="宋体" >个月即可打造一款品类明星单品，且毛利率不低于</font><font face="STSong-Light" >30%</font><font face="宋体" >；&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >食品部人员能力迅速提升，深受领导和其它部门同事认可。&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=119  valign=top  style="width:89.4000pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(234,234,234);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="line-height:15.0000pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:STSong-Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2010.07&#8211;2010.11</span></b><span style="font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:'宋 体';mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=578  valign=top  colspan=2  style="width:433.9000pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(234,234,234);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-left:5.0000pt;line-height:15.0000pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-weight:bold;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >供应链优化项目</span></b><span style="font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:'宋 体';mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=119  valign=top  rowspan=5  style="width:89.4000pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=M