-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >北京稻香村食品有限责任公司&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=74  valign=top  style="width:55.5500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-right:-9.3500pt;mso-para-margin-right:-0.7800gd;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >项目简介：</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >北京稻香村作为老&nbsp;字&nbsp;号&nbsp;企业，实体店定位为社区店，柜台式销售，每家店面积<font face="STSong-Light" >100</font><font face="宋体" >平米</font><font face="STSong-Light" >-300</font><font face="宋体" >平米，为满足社区顾客需求，非自制商品合格供方产品繁多，供应商复杂。</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >本次项目要求在不影响社区店便利性的条件下，对产品进行删减，供应商进行合并。&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=74  valign=top  style="width:55.5500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-right:-9.3500pt;mso-para-margin-right:-0.7800gd;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >项目职责：</span><span style="font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></td><td width=504  valign=top  style="width:378.3500pt;padding:0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt ;background:rgb(255,255,255);" ><p class=MsoNormal ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >1<font face="宋体" >、门店走访调研；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >2<font face="宋体" >、产品规划；</font></span><span style="font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-hansi-font-family:STSong-Light;mso-bidi-font-family:STSong-Light;font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;" >3<font face